<div class="toc">
<div class="toc-l">What's in this benchmark</div>
<ol>
<li><a href="#methodology">Methodology and what was measured</a></li>
<li><a href="#mechanics">The mechanics: length, cuts, shot rate, captions</a></li>
<li><a href="#hooks">Hook taxonomy: what is saturated, what is open</a></li>
