<p><strong>How this benchmark was built.</strong> This is the same competitive intelligence work Treetop runs inside client engagements, with the client-specific analysis removed. If you want the equivalent for your category, <a href="/contact" style="color:#00C853;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,200,83,0.3);">start with a strategy call</a>.</p>
